### 13. Smart Outfit Matcher

**Screen:** Modal from shoe detail or dedicated route (`/outfits`)

AI-powered outfit suggestions based on selected shoes, helping users visualize complete looks.

- **Outfit Gallery:** Curated outfit photos featuring the selected shoe style pulled from fashion APIs or user submissions.
- **Style Tags:** Filter outfits by occasion (casual, formal, athletic, streetwear) and season (spring, summer, fall, winter).
- **Color Palette Extraction:** Automatically extract colors from the shoe image and suggest complementary clothing colors.
- **My Wardrobe Integration:** Optional feature to photograph/catalog clothing items and get AI matching suggestions.
- **AI Outfit Generator:** Text-to-image generation of outfit ideas featuring the shoe (powered by image generation API).
- **Save Outfit Ideas:** Bookmark outfit combinations for later reference.
- **Weather-Appropriate Suggestions:** Factor in current weather for outfit recommendations.
- **Brand Partnership Looks:** Featured outfits from brand collaborations with direct links to purchase coordinating pieces.

**Data Requirements:**
- New `savedOutfits` array in UserContext with: shoeId, outfitImageUrl, tags, notes
- Optional integration with fashion/outfit API (e.g., Pinterest, styled product feeds)

