### 17. Voice-Enabled Assistant

**Enhancement to existing AI Expert tab (`/assistant`)

Voice input and output capabilities for hands-free interaction with the AI shoe expert.

- **Voice Input:** Microphone button for speech-to-text queries (useful when hands are busy trying on shoes in-store).
- **Voice Output:** Text-to-speech responses from the assistant (toggleable in settings).
- **Wake Word (Optional):** "Hey ShoeFit" activation for completely hands-free interaction (iOS/Android voice recognition APIs).
- **Voice Commands:** Natural language commands like:
  - "Add this to my wishlist"
  - "Find me running shoes under 150 dollars"
  - "What size should I get in Nike?"
  - "Compare these two shoes"
- **Accessibility Mode:** Enhanced voice features for visually impaired users with full VoiceOver/TalkBack support.
- **Multi-language Support:** Voice recognition and responses in multiple languages based on device locale.

**Technical Requirements:**
- Integration with expo-speech for text-to-speech
- Integration with expo-av for audio recording + speech-to-text API (Google Cloud Speech / Apple Speech Framework)
- Voice command parser to map spoken commands to app actions

