## Technical Considerations

### New Dependencies to Evaluate

| Feature | Potential Dependencies |
|---------|----------------------|
| Price Tracking | Background fetch, push notifications, price API |
| AR Try-On | expo-ar, 3D model hosting, MLKit/Vision |
| Voice Assistant | expo-speech, expo-av, speech-to-text API |
| Store Locator | Google Places API, expo-location |
| Offline Mode | @react-native-async-storage/async-storage enhancements, NetInfo |
| Social Network | Backend API (Firebase, Supabase, or custom) |

### Backend Requirements

Several features require server-side infrastructure:

- **User accounts & authentication** (for social features, cross-device sync)
- **Community content moderation**
- **Price data aggregation and caching**
- **Push notification service**
- **3D model asset hosting**

### Privacy Considerations

- Social features must be opt-in with clear privacy controls
- Foot measurements are sensitive biometric data; ensure transparent data handling
- Price tracking requires clear disclosure about data collection
- Location features must request explicit permission

